__pycache__/
*.pyc
tests/.tmp-test-*/
.DS_Store

# Trusted per-project registries live outside this repository's history on
# purpose (README.md: "вне самих репозиториев") — they hold another project's
# absolute paths, product details and policy specifics, none of it this
# tool's business to version. Add yours locally under projects/<id>/.
/projects/*
!/projects/README.md

# Personal layer (rules/personal.md): one person's vendors, models, limits and
# machine specifics. Copied into the release from disk like projects/, never
# versioned — every teammate keeps their own or none.
/personal/
